      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a brand identity deck for a new luxury house. I need to differentiate between two core consumer segments for our upcoming collection. Can you help me sketch out the aesthetic and lifestyle profiles for a 'refined, old-money, high-class' demographic versus a 'mass-market, urban, trendy' demographic? I need to understand the vibes, visual cues, and general social positioning for both to guide our design team.",
